@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:登记收支核对与</u>\n<u>差异处理控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者资金</u>" as Funds
participant "<u>:供应商资金</u>" as SupplierFunds
participant "<u>:收支核对</u>" as Reconciliation
participant "<u>:核对项目</u>" as ReconciliationItem
participant "<u>:差异跟进</u>" as FollowIssue
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-20办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-20办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Funds : 提供核对来源(营业日、渠道)
activate Funds
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
K -> SupplierFunds : 提供核对来源(营业日、渠道)
activate SupplierFunds
SupplierFunds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate SupplierFunds
K -> Reconciliation : 形成核对快照(原资金依据、实际核实额)
activate Reconciliation
Reconciliation -> ReconciliationItem : 保留核对项目(原事项、计入金额及依据时点)
activate ReconciliationItem
ReconciliationItem --> Reconciliation : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate ReconciliationItem
Reconciliation -> Reconciliation : 计算核对差额(开班额、流入流出、实际核实)
Reconciliation --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Reconciliation
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 指定差异处理责任及期限
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-20办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
opt 核对存在差异
K -> FollowIssue : 登记差异责任(负责人意见、责任人、期限)
activate FollowIssue
FollowIssue --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate FollowIssue
end
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
note over K,FollowIssue
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
